# Website → WhatsApp bot integration (site root par ye file .env me daalo)
# Dev me agar set nahi ho to http://localhost:3001 auto-use hota hai.
# Deploy ke baad public bot URL daalo, e.g. https://organicswaad-bot.onrender.com
VITE_BOT_API_URL=

# NOTE (deploy ke baad): bot URL cross-origin hoga — vercel.json aur
# public/_headers me CSP `connect-src 'self'` me us URL ko add karna
# (warna browser order forward block karega).
